Error [E3403]: `Clock comparison` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> pure_code_rejects_clock_provenance_laundered_through_a_struct_2.jet:6:19
    |
  6 |     return holder.clock == holder.clock
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine (D-PURE2).
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: Clock comparison
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403

Error [E0312]: `Clock` doesn't support `==`
  --> pure_code_rejects_clock_provenance_laundered_through_a_struct_2.jet:6:19
    |
  6 |     return holder.clock == holder.clock
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Value equality requires the Equatable trait
 Fix: Add `#Equatable` before the type, implement `Equatable` by hand, or compare individual fields
